        }
      ],
      "notifications": [
        {
          "title": "The more I know, the less I know",
          "text": "I am not my bodies. They die, and I remain.\n\nWhen I absorb them, their memories become part of me. I can recall every detail of every life I have lived.\n\nYet without bodies, I remember nothing and feel nothing. Without them, I do not exist at all.\n\nNothing in those memories tells me what I am.\n\nNo one I have absorbed has ever known anything like me.\n\n[i]Permanent Upgrade [color=gold]More Than The Sum Of My Parts[/color][/i]  \n+10% [icon=xp]XP",
          "imageUrl": null,
          "id": "wb_tyupFvuVQ6YpQQCXPw"
        }
      ],
